issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99615","id":3422283155,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7L--WT","user":{"login":"CsloudX","id":35988767,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1OTg4NzY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35988767?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CsloudX","html_url":"https://github.com/CsloudX","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CsloudX/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CsloudX/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CsloudX/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CsloudX/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CsloudX/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CsloudX/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CsloudX/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CsloudX/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CsloudX/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-20T14:17:24Z","updated_at":"2025-10-20T14:17:24Z","body":"no body fix this!?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3422283155/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5014677822","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99615#issuecomment-5014677822","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99615","id":5014677822,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKuXpPg","user":{"login":"nhjydywd","id":38578239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NTc4MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38578239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nhjydywd","html_url":"https://github.com/nhjydywd","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nhjydywd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nhjydywd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nhjydywd/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nhjydywd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nhjydywd/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nhjydywd/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nhjydywd/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nhjydywd/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nhjydywd/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-19T06:17:57Z","updated_at":"2026-07-19T06:17:57Z","body":"The current implementation temporarily changes the caller-visible, object-level `block_signals` state to suppress one internal notification. This seems like an abstraction mismatch: saving and restoring the old state fixes the immediate leak, but the same pattern may cause other state or notification issues later.\n\nIn this path, we only need to prevent the intermediate notification from `set_as_ratio()`, then notify once after the Slider's drag state is ready. A somewhat larger but more systematic solution would be:\n\nI propose extracting the conversion from the current [`Range::set_as_ratio()`](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/c12e51972a41665743be79c7d3e3fd5c871d97f3/scene/gui/range.cpp#L301-L319):\n\n```cpp\ndouble Range::_get_value_from_ratio(double p_ratio) const {\n\t// Existing exponential/linear conversion, step snapping and clamping.\n}\n\nvoid Range::_set_as_ratio_no_notify(double p_ratio) {\n\t_set_value_no_signal(_get_value_from_ratio(p_ratio));\n}\n\nvoid Range::set_as_ratio(double p_ratio) {\n\tset_value(_get_value_from_ratio(p_ratio));\n}\n```\n\nThen replace the temporary signal blocking in [`Slider::gui_input()`](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/c12e51972a41665743be79c7d3e3fd5c871d97f3/scene/gui/slider.cpp#L73-L87) with:\n\n```cpp\ndouble grab_width = theme_cache.center_grabber ? 0.0 : (double)grabber->get_width();\ndouble grab_height = theme_cache.center_grabber ? 0.0 : (double)grabber->get_height();\ndouble max = orientation == VERTICAL ? get_size().height - grab_height : get_size().width - grab_width;\nif (orientation == VERTICAL) {\n\t_set_as_ratio_no_notify(1 - (((double)grab.pos - (grab_height / 2.0)) / max));\n} else {\n\tdouble v = ((double)grab.pos - (grab_width / 2.0)) / max;\n\t_set_as_ratio_no_notify(is_layout_rtl() ? 1 - v : v);\n}\ngrab.active = true;\ngrab.uvalue = get_as_ratio();\n\n_notify_shared_value_changed();\n```\n\nThis never changes the caller's block state and notifies each shared owner exactly once.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5014677822/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]